# committed accidentally, regardless of which package was the working directory.
**/artifacts/
**/events/
**/recordings/
**/incidents/
**/.staging/
**/clips/
**/runs/
**/models/**/*.onnx
**/models/**/*.engine
**/models/**/*.plan

